From: Vahiru <nekovahiru@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Input: himax-spi: add per-stage pipeline counters, contact birth log, and debugfs frame dumps

Add observability interfaces to the himax-spi touch processing pipeline:

- algo/stats (read/write sysfs attribute): per-stage counters for frames, macro
  zones, palm rejection rules, peak filters, contacts, and tracker events.
- algo/contacts_log (read-only sysfs attribute): ring buffer of the last 16
  newly created tracks recording frame sequence, position, area, signal sum, and
  edge flag.
- debugfs binary attributes (/sys/kernel/debug/himax-hx83121a/frame_raw and
  frame): 4800-byte (40x60 s16 little-endian) snapshots of the baseline-subtracted
  raw frame and post-filter frame, managed via devm_add_action_or_reset() and
  synchronized with ts->op_lock.

Origin: local
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
